\newlabel{tab:time}{{3}{15}{CPU time in milliseconds for the polynomial of Section~\ref {subsec:poly} and the Bard function of Section~\ref {subsec:bard}, summed over the sweep in $o$. For each $o$ the mean and median over the $100$ starting points are taken, as in Tables~\ref {tab:poly} and~\ref {tab:bard}, and those values are then summed. The ratio columns give second-order over first-order, so that values below $1$ favour the second-order variant}{table.3}{}}
